DESCRIPTION:It doesn’t take long to fall in love with the comedic humor o
 f Darren Fleet . Fleet is making waves in the comedy world and if you’re 
 smart\, you’ll want to ride this one.\n\nHe has performed live with the l
 ikes of Rickey Smiley\, Karlous Miller\, and the cast of "Wild ’N Out" am
 ongst others. Fleet has been performing comedy strong for 5 years now and h
 as graced stages throughout the US. He has performed and headlined at sever
 al comedy clubs including The Funny Bone\, The Improv\, Stardome\, Comedy Z
 one\, and Punchline Comedy Lounge\, among others.\n\nFleet has also been fo
 rtunate enough to showcase his talents at the BET Awards\, Essence Festival
 \, CIAA All-Star Weekend\, and Bronner Bros Hair Convention. If comedy isn
 ’t enough to keep him busy\, he has decided to throw his hat into the act
 ing arena. This fall\, he will premiere his television show\, “What Behoo
 ves Me\,” which will air on ICTV.\n\nFleet has built a following of more 
 than 2 million followers on social media alone through his Instagram and Fa
 cebook with his humorous rants on various aspects of everyday life.\n\n**Th
 e Private Skybox Suite includes up to 10 tickets\, a $400 Food & Beverage v
 oucher\, a personal server\, a private restroom\, and all gratuity charges.
 \n\nAny additional food and drink costs above $400 will be billed at the en
 d of the show. The guest count can not exceed 10 people. All club policies 
 and safety guidelines will be enforced. Please note that the skybox is on t
 he second floor of our showroom\, and is NOT wheelchair accessible.\n\nMana
 gement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility w
 ho they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://
 comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-darren-fleet-37437/
